{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_03_c",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e17c8c924b4c6899c1ab8bbdde4cd84fcf8a4d3773006a672496946ef68fea68",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000016:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c03ba492b7bac5abac2714c86e01098386d7c88ad979d054d90f947b1a8bbae",
      "text": "偶像大运动会 开幕！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a646f650539f9292adb4dc4f86702e718d11c73e64fd1dcf7226420282f4d4e0",
      "text": "偶像大运动会终于开始了！\n第一项比赛是两人三足！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:dc92489c9de04a6599ce5404d446730046825e4e4b4286124a04d9ad79b8fddc",
      "text": "一路领先领跑的是这两位！\n来自315 Production的……W！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6d1d28334304e8efcbefc0a423fa71cfb9f8583b95e800b08d11fcfc33895c21",
      "text": "一、二、一、二……等等，喂，悠介！\n别自顾自加快节奏啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:09860e888e518c09626dafc2793ad233e4227234af4c23eaf5151f1d26397c69",
      "text": "抱歉抱歉！\n我想着就算是享介，不用我说也能跟上的嘛！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a35904930641ee8b8513ecf9faebe03fedb9832c428f4aeaac8ba82ff3491106",
      "text": "就这样拉开压倒性的差距，\n一口气甩开所有人跑完2圈吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e9e1490073abca7850e07536ee12cdd9af7e3b9bc77409bdcc57c5131b1418ea",
      "text": "一旦决定的事就听不进劝……我知道了啦。\n但你要考虑体力分配。现在的速度已经是极限了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c8481c4a02a9b7d8abcd92af0bb875334548c76922530b0c0cfc2850bdfd1a3",
      "text": "收到！我说，享介。\n就这样一口气拿下优胜，去终点的舞台上唱歌吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000081:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3cd25bf274f66d0664ed3078a12d0206cd1f7a819d36824da67d5ed8fd10fcbd",
      "text": "嗯。为了更接近男极KING，\n一定要拿到第1名！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea460e64a1f29f32b4159bb164a1c53bbd0ac8b965e802574c25f2b19213c24e",
      "text": "W实在太快了！谁也追不上！但是\n其他偶像也依然还有机会！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000097:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea0687bb7fcdda8d7bc954f72e802c27251e0e7f791da9e50aed29e9f48f32d4",
      "text": "在跑完场馆内的跑道后，\n场外还有许许多多的比赛项目在等待着选手们。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_03:1_4_002_03_c:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:635255e80305e51ada6055af0cba9f75f37da5f42a316294375e6ba90dd98ae1",
      "text": "能站上舞台的只有第1名的偶像！\n究竟是谁能摘得胜利的荣耀呢！？",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
